WEBVTT

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:04.580
Good morning, Gintaro-sama, Haru-sama.

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:10.470
Yes, good morning.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.960
Wait one moment.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:17.380
Here you go.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.570
Good morning.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:28.540
Good morning. You're here early.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.980
I have an easier time getting 
out of bed when it's warmer.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.150
It's already June.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:37.140
Ah, are those summer tangerines?

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.110
Yes.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.030
Why don't you leave them inside?

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.100
The offerings inside are for the gods.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.990
Our fox spirits like their 
offerings out here.

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:50.580
Oh? It sounds like you heard 
from the herald himself.

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:55.330
When I was little, my great-grandfather 
used to say that

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:59.310
there were fox spirits dancing on 
the roof of the Inari shrine nearby.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:01.310
You also have fox spirits here?

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:04.350
We do.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.170
Yes, of course.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:49.360
<b>I'm Sorry</b>

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.390
Satoru-kun, I can take it from here.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.380
You're gonna be late for practice.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.800
Okay.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.720
Satoru, it's going to rain today.

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:05.180
Really?

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.910
It'll just be a drizzle.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.420
You probably won't need an umbrella.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.140
I'll take one to be safe.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:15.600
No way. The forecast said 
it would be sunny today.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.550
Heh, forecast?

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:22.030
I guess I should take an umbrella, too.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.580
You can get wet.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.990
Haru-chan's so cold to me...

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.640
Anyway...

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.700
Why do they always offer tangerines?

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.210
That's so weird!

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.580
Hey!

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:46.250
Tangerines are hard to find this 
time of year, stupid brat!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.180
It's weird for foxes to eat tangerines.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:52.740
Gin, don't throw a fit over a tangerine.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:53.820
Come on, Haru.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.150
You're not supposed to waste food.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.920
Not my fault...

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.320
In that case...

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.870
What do you like?

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.860
W-Well, I like fried tofu!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:10.160
You're just eating whatever 
they put before you.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.760
I bet you've never tried 
anything else before.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.330
That's not true!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.830
Now, now.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:20.550
Oh, I've heard that 
foxes like blue cheese.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.050
There was a special on TV.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.510
Would you like to try some?

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:25.010
Cheese?

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.270
That was a special on 
foxes in the wild.

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.850
Don't feed Haru anything strange.

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:35.930
Have fun, Satoru!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.300
This one's big.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:42.680
Oh, that's a summer tangerine.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.900
Dad never learns.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.860
I don't mind it when Tatsuo does it.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:51.330
What? You're really soft on Dad.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:54.140
You always complain 
when I give you stuff.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:55.960
Tatsuo is allowed to get away with it.

00:05:56.760 --> 00:06:00.790
Makoto! You need to get ready 
to go or you'll be late!

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:02.470
Okay!

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:07.220
Dad, Haru-chan likes your 
standard fried tofu.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.380
Oh, really?

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:09.830
Standard.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.240
You should have said something sooner.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.430
I'm off!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.840
Be careful.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:29.500
I guess it's gonna rain no 
matter how many times I try.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.110
That's a tiny flame.

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:34.440
Why do you have to be so annoying?

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.840
I can make bigger flames.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:40.190
A bigger flame will 
bring different things.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:41.870
What about you?

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:52.010
First of all, you're not 
holding your hand right.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.390
Want me to teach you what to do?

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.410
I don't need your help!

00:06:56.410 --> 00:07:00.100
I'm not going to tell fortunes 
to suck up to humans.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:05.760
Besides, you have a giant body and tail.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:07.570
A big flame is nothing special.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.750
You need to grow up and act your age.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:13.530
Seriously...

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:17.040
A big body with a small heart.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:20.180
Yeah, that's right.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.220
It was all my fault.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.210
All my fault.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:29.790
Hey! Come down!

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:32.800
Go to sleep already.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.390
I'm not tired!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.800
You're running away because 
you can't beat me!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.340
Gintaro-sama, Haru-sama.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.540
I'll be heading out for a bit.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:49.130
Please watch over the shrine for us.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.910
Tatsuo...

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.930
<i>It's so quiet.</i>

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.790
<i>That cloud looks like Grandpa Matsu!</i>

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.650
<i>That one looks like Satoru!</i>

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:31.140
<i>That stupidly large one is Gintaro.</i>

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:41.040
But seriously, I don't get how 
he can sleep so much everyday.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:00.310
I'm—

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.080
Wait!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.010
Hurry up!

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:04.240
Wait for me!

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:10.270
More noisy humans...

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:13.440
It's ringing!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.820
<i>I want to sit next to Taiga-kun.</i>

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:25.460
<i>I want to be in the same 
group as Taiga-kun.</i>

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:29.360
Sa-chan, what did you wish for?

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.170
It's a secret.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:31.950
Why?!

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.880
Kids these days...

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:36.260
Come on! Tell me!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.770
You go first!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:39.350
It's embarrassing!

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:40.760
What do you mean?

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.560
Jeez! Keep it down!

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.900
Oh, we need to wash our hands.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:46.270
Yep, that's right!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.480
It's too late!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.740
Hey, Aki! Sachina!

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.040
What are you doing here?

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.850
We're gonna tell the teacher on you!

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:57.860
Yuuya!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.700
More noisemakers...

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.360
We aren't doing anything wrong.

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.780
We live nearby.

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:05.660
But you're supposed 
to go straight home!

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:08.330
You're the one who's always 
following us around!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.520
You probably like Sa-chan!

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:11.160
What?

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:14.270
They call people like you "stalkers."

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:16.540
What?! That's not true!

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.470
Uh, Yuu-chan?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.640
Is that true?

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.100
It's not!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.900
It is!

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:25.550
Why you...

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.020
Shut up, stupid Aki!

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:32.790
Stop it!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.260
Shut up, ugly!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.650
Hey!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.400
Stop it!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.610
That's cold!

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.910
Th-These kids make me so mad!

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.290
I'm mad now!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.210
Yeah! Make them pay!

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.750
Stupid Yuuya!

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.090
Yes! Way to go!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:55.860
That's the spirit!

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:57.310
One more time!

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:58.770
Don't let that boy beat you!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:10:59.550
You're gonna get it!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.250
You started it!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.250
Make them pay in spades! Keep it up!

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.710
Yeah, like that!

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.340
There!

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.510
Take that!

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:08.340
Darn it!

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:14.470
Don't let those boys win!

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.390
Wait a second....

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.610
How can he sleep through all of this?

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:27.430
Hey! Stop it!

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.080
Get 'em, Yuu-chan!

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.550
Don't let them beat you!

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:31.170
Do it!

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.290
Get down from there!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.300
Take this!

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:36.040
Dual wield!

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.350
Ow...

00:11:56.950 --> 00:12:00.440
Uh-oh...

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.040
Not my fault!

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:03.280
Wait up!

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:06.990
A-Aki-chan...

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:08.680
What do we do?

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.830
We're sorry!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.870
What?!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:18.050
Hold it right there!

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.650
Wait...

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:57.920
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:16.220
John! Why are you barking again?!

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.690
There's nothing there!

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.200
That scared me!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.410
Huh?

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.600
Where am I...

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:19.170
I'm lost...

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.380
And I'm supposed to be a herald...

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:25.510
Satoru will be worried 
when he gets home...

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:30.520
I probably won't be able to divine 
the location of the shrine...

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:32.810
Satoru...

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:37.770
I just noticed that this 
is an Inari shrine.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.190
Do I spend the night here...

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.440
Stupid.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:52.990
What are you doing?

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:00.020
O-Oh, it's just Gintaro.

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:02.230
That's not very nice.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.380
I came down here to get you.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:07.360
Weren't you asleep?!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.930
It's not possible to sleep 
through that noise.

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:13.390
And you were the loudest one.

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:20.480
Man, don't wander around if you 
don't know how to get home.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.360
I never asked you to come look for me!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.570
Come on now...

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.770
I didn't have to look for you.

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.240
The shrine's right over there.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.700
You must be blind.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.020
Then leave me alone!

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:43.360
I wish I could, but I can't.

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:48.460
If I don't do something, 
it'll only be worse later on.

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:51.570
Why didn't you do something?!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:55.390
Ha-Haru ran away again?

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:01.390
Come on. Let's go.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.780
What are you doing here?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.260
Yo.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:15.190
Oh, that must have been awful.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.420
I'm gonna make them pay!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.700
Well, they're just kids...

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:24.560
Oh, I'm glad it didn't rain.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.320
I ran back in a hurry.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.550
That's weird...

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.230
Hey, it's them!

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.800
What's going on, Dad?

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.770
Oh. Welcome home, Makoto.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.270
Makoto-oneechan...

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.070
We're sorry!

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:55.940
We're the ones who broke the dippers.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.340
And we also messed up the fox statue.

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:02.160
Sorry, we did something wrong...

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:03.780
But then we ran away...

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.290
We won't do it again...

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.540
So...

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.460
Please don't curse us!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.170
What?

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.470
Th-That's what Grandma said.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.110
You've angered the gods!

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:22.600
If you fool around in the shrine, 
the fox spirits will eat you!

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.270
Right?

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.070
It's okay.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.350
The fox spirits won't eat you.

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:34.150
Really?

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:35.310
Yes.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:39.660
You shouldn't have broken the dippers,

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.350
but what's important is that

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:44.060
you understand what you've 
done wrong and apologized.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.530
I'm sure the fox spirits 
will forgive you.

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:54.390
Besides, the fox spirits will be 
lonely if you don't come to visit.

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.720
So please drop by when you have time.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.760
I'm so relieved.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:00.670
Uh-huh.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:05.340
Tatsuo's too soft.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:06.740
Now, now.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:10.260
Uh, here.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.940
We used our allowance to buy these.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:17.300
Grandma told us that the fox 
spirit here likes them.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:21.240
They didn't have any tangerines, 
so we bought oranges.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.620
Thank you!

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:27.000
I'm sure the fox spirits will be happy.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.280
Forget it.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:36.560
They apologized, so I'll forgive them.

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:39.180
Too bad that I hate tangerines!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:43.680
Rain?

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:46.140
Oh? But it's so bright.

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:52.060
It's a fox wedding.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:57.320
Hey, why are sun showers 
called fox weddings?

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.560
Well...

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:03.150
I've heard that foxes 
are having a wedding,

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:05.830
when it rains while the sun is out...

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:09.150
Or that foxes are responsible 
for making it rain,

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.560
but I don't know the real reason.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.220
It's a good question.

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:16.960
That's weird.

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:20.270
Yeah, it's just something 
that's been passed down.

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:23.810
Humans shouldn't blame 
foxes for everything.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.000
Let's play in the rain 
before we go home!

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:29.420
Come on!

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:30.410
Yeah!

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.920
Make sure you don't get sick.

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:34.080
Uh-huh!

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.110
Bye-bye, Makoto-oneechan!

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:40.030
A fox wedding, huh...

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:46.180
Oh, why don't you ask 
Haru-chan to be your bride?

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:47.590
Since Haru-chan's a girl.

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.540
Why?!

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:52.980
I don't like anything about Gintaro!

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:56.110
And I want nothing to do 
with this noisy brat.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:58.240
Oh, welcome back!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.550
Welcome back.

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:02.270
Oh, Satoru!

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.590
I'm home, Haru.

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:07.420
You're back early!

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.090
Yeah, we got out of practice early.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.940
Satoru, you're wet! Why?

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.530
Didn't you take an umbrella?

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:17.150
Oh, it was a short run.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.380
And it was a fox wedding,

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.910
so I didn't mind getting wet.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.870
Since it's like you 
were making it rain.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.600
Jeez... You'll catch a cold...

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.590
At least everything worked out.

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.360
Here are your oranges, Gin.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.810
Oranges?

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.500
They're similar to tangerines.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.240
Oh, the rain's stopped.

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:43.240
Hey, what are you holding, Dad?

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.740
Oh, this?

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.150
It's a present for Haru-sama.

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.930
You said that she likes fried tofu,

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:54.820
but I was thinking that it would 
be better with some udon.

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:57.470
I'm a big fan.

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:59.990
Oh... should I have brought 
some hot water after all?

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:05.500
Come on, Dad!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:06.830
Are you okay?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:11.810
Haru, stop being so stubborn.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:14.600
You like cream buns, right?

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:19.030
Satoru! Don't tell them!

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:21.050
What? Cream buns?

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:26.060
Yeah, someone made an 
offering of them once.

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:27.120
Oh...

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:31.720
Hey, and you were making fun of me?

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:34.310
I like cream buns, too.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.730
They're really good.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:38.540
You're just as weird as I am.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:46.410
Take that!

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:49.310
Ow!

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.290
Turn orange, Gintaro!

00:21:57.160 --> 00:22:00.070
I told you to stop wasting the tangerines!

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:01.630
Shut up!

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:07.790
A rainbow...

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:17.370
That's lovely.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:22.500
The sky is the one thing 
that never changes...

00:22:24.680 --> 00:22:28.530
Oh, what were you saying 
about cream buns?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.060
Haru likes them.

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:31.770
Really?

00:22:31.770 --> 00:22:35.320
I think it's very cute, Haru-chan.

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:38.410
Shut up!

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:18.760
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:18.760
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:24:11.230 --> 00:24:13.140
Hey, this is Gintaro.

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:15.450
You want to know 
more about shrines?

00:24:15.450 --> 00:24:17.640
Go look it up yourself.

00:24:17.790 --> 00:24:18.500
Next time...

00:24:18.170 --> 00:24:19.300
Next time:

00:24:18.910 --> 00:26:21.010
<b>It Really Doesn't Matter</b>

00:24:19.300 --> 00:24:21.010
"It Really Doesn't Matter."

00:24:21.010 --> 00:24:23.240
May fortune be with Satoru.

00:24:23.840 --> 00:24:24.680
Hey!
